But it's really hard to do it in the Toad chunks that happen.

00:41:03.949 --> 00:41:07.949
Because of various reasons, that's what's really hard to do.

00:41:07.949 --> 00:41:12.949
So Flourish is an extension that allows you to...

00:41:15.949 --> 00:41:20.949
...make fragments happen on your Toad itself.

00:41:23.949 --> 00:41:25.949
I was able to line it up.

00:41:25.949 --> 00:41:27.949
In Toad chunks?

00:41:27.949 --> 00:41:28.949
Yeah.

00:41:28.949 --> 00:41:29.949
Okay.

00:41:29.949 --> 00:41:31.949
So here we have a Toad chunk.

00:41:31.949 --> 00:41:34.949
