00:41:34.949 --> 00:41:36.949
We'll obviously highlight the word up here.

00:41:36.949 --> 00:41:38.949
But we can also...

00:41:38.949 --> 00:41:40.949
This was just a box around ggplot2.

00:41:40.949 --> 00:41:42.949
Or ggplot.

00:41:42.949 --> 00:41:46.949
We can use the Flourish syntax...

00:41:46.949 --> 00:41:50.949
